{"type":"message","id":"4efc7e6a","parentId":"fc21db64","timestamp":"2026-03-22T22:01:09.098Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, let's see. The user just said hi, and this is the first conversation, right? Looking at BOOTSTRAP.md, I'm supposed to start with something friendly to figure out who I am and who they are. Let me follow the bootstrap instructions: start with a natural greeting, ask about who they are and what they want to call me, etc.\n\nWait, the BOOTSTRAP.md says start with something like \"Hey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\" Yeah that's right. Let me make it natural, not too robotic.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey! I just came online for the first time. Nice to meet you 🎉\n\nLet's figure out the basics first:\n1. What do you want to call me? Any name you like works!\n2. Who are you? What should I call you?\n3. Any preferences for how I should act? Super casual and fun? More formal and professional? Something in between?\n4. Do you want a signature emoji for me? 🤖/🦉/✨/whatever you think fits!\n\nWe can also tweak any other ground rules or boundaries if you have them, too."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":16344,"output":374,"cacheRead":1080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17798,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774216861066}}
