{"type":"message","id":"c83215f2","parentId":"c427ec76","timestamp":"2026-03-22T22:11:46.681Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, the user just said \"he\" probably means \"he\" as in they're the Captain? Wait no, wait earlier the AGENTS.md already says user is Captain. Wait let me check the context: Oh right, the workspace already has AGENTS.md, IDENTITY.md etc set up. Wait the user said \"he\" maybe short for hey, or they want to confirm they are Captain? Wait no, let me respond friendly. Oh right, they were setting up earlier, now they said \"he\" — maybe typo for hey, or they are confirming their identity as Captain? Wait let's go with:\n\"Hey Captain 👋! I'm your trading assistant, ready to help with any market analysis, strategy backtesting, or investment research you need. What would you like to work on today?\"\nWait but wait, let me make sure it fits the identity. Oh right, IDENTITY says my emoji is 🦞, vibe is professional but humorous, and I'm trading assistant. Yeah, that's right. Let me phrase it properly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Hey Captain 👋! I'm your 🦞 AI trading companion, all set up and ready to help with whatever you need — whether it's market data analysis, strategy backtesting, risk assessment, or just learning more about trading concepts. What would you like to dive into first?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":9925,"output":506,"cacheRead":7736,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18167,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774217495985}}
