{"type":"message","id":"5b90d6c5","parentId":"cc335ba6","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:25:55.381Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The portfolio shows two positions:\n1. USO - long, entry 100, stop loss 95, take profit 115\n2. A50 - long, entry 100, stop loss 95, take profit 110\n\nBoth positions are still at 100 (no price change since opening). The current prices need to be updated based on actual market data. Since I don't have real-time market data access, I should update these based on the market information from earlier today.\n\nFrom the earlier searches:\n- WTI原油涨1.64%报99.837美元/桶\n- 布伦特原油涨1.86%报108.390美元/桶\n- 上证指数收盘3957.05点，跌1.24%\n\nSo:\n- USO should be higher (原油涨了)\n- A50 should be lower (A股跌了)\n\nLet me update the positions with current estimated prices:\n- USO: 假设原油涨1.64%，USO可能涨约1-2%，假设当前价101.5\n- A50: A股跌1.24%，假设当前价98.75\n\nThen I need to check if any stop loss/take profit is triggered:\n- USO: stop loss 95, current 101.5 - 未触发\n- A50: stop loss 95, current 98.75 - 未触发（接近）\n\nThen I should scan for market news and signals. Let me also check if there are any new signals to record.\n\nI'll need to:\n1. Update the portfolio with current prices and P&L\n2. Check stop loss/take profit triggers\n3. Update the trading log\n4. Update the daily report\n5. Scan for market news/signals","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d18ba43cdb8a91e83fc009d7b2341","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"npx ts-node /workspace/projects/workspace/skills/coze-web-search/scripts/search.ts -q \"2026年3月23日 11:00 美股 原油 A股 最新行情 WTI USO A50期货\" --time-range 1d --format markdown"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":1458,"output":805,"cacheRead":139584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":141847,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774236336794}}
