{"type":"message","id":"49f75cec","parentId":"dd502f9d","timestamp":"2026-03-23T15:44:42.490Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to add a closed_positions array or trade_history to track the closed trade. Let me also update the account equity calculation.\n\nTotal equity = cash + positions = 7350 + 2415 = 9765 USDT\nUnrealized P&L = -85 (A50)\nRealized P&L = -150 (USO)\nDaily P&L = (9765 - 10000) / 10000 = -2.35%\n\nWait, the account summary says equity is 9823.5. Let me check:\n- Current balance: 7350 (cash)\n- Equity: 9823.5\n- Unrealized: -176.5\n\nSo:\n7350 - 176.5 = 7173.5, which doesn't equal 9823.5.\n\nLet me recalculate:\n7350 + (position values) = equity\n7350 + (positions total) = 9823.5\nSo positions total = 2473.5\n\nIf A50 is 25 units at 96.6 = 2415, that's close but not exactly 2473.5.\n\nLet me just use the numbers that are there and make them consistent:\n- Cash: 7350\n- A50 position: 2415 (25 * 96.6)\n- Total equity: 9765\n- Unrealized P&L: -85 (A50: 2415 - 2500)\n- Realized P&L: -150 (USO: 2850 - 3000)\n\nSo I should update:\n- current_balance: 7350\n- cash_available: 7350\n- equity: 9765\n- unrealized_pnl: -85\n\n\n- realized_pnl: -150\n\nI'll incorporate the latest calculations into the JSON data, ensuring the numbers align correctly and reflect the most recent portfolio status.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d1b5e99e9a5a010d90aeba8dfe0f0","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/paper-trading/portfolio.json","newText":"  \"account\": {\n    \"name\": \"高风险高收益模拟账户\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-03-23T07:15:00+08:00\",\n    \"initial_capital\": 10000,\n    \"currency\": \"USDT\",\n    \"current_balance\": 7350,\n    \"cash_available\": 7350,\n    \"equity\": 9765,\n    \"unrealized_pnl\": -85,\n    \"realized_pnl\": -150,\n    \"daily_pnl\": \"-2.35%\",\n    \"risk_level\": \"high\",\n    \"max_single_loss\": 5,\n    \"max_daily_los