{"type":"message","id":"d6cbc5e7","parentId":"92db71c1","timestamp":"2026-03-23T17:08:14.437Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户确认了\"胜率70%，每单盈利50%\"的目标，并说这是\"期权交易生存的最低要求\"。\n\n用户现在是Captain，决策权在他手中。他明确确认了目标，我需要：\n\n1. 创建新的高胜率期权交易策略配置\n2. 设计交易系统\n3. 创建追踪表\n4. 按他的要求执行\n\n期权交易确实需要高胜率，因为期权有时间价值衰减。但70%胜率+50%盈利每单仍然是极高的目标。\n\n我应该：\n1. 尊重Captain的决定\n2. 按要求创建策略配置\n3. 但在报告中用红色标注风险\n4. 提供具体的执行方案\n\n现在开始创建交易策略配置文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ 确认：高胜率期权交易策略\n\n---\n\n### 📋 策略配置文件创建\n\n我理解了，期权交易确实需要高胜率才能应对时间价值衰减。现在开始创建策略配置。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d1baaf0025079ba4a9b1742a7fa98","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"{\n  \"strategy\": {\n    \"name\": \"高胜率期权日内交易\",\n    \"type\": \"options_intraday\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-03-24T01:07:00+08:00\",\n    \"status\": \"active\"\n  },\n  \"targets\": {\n    \"win_rate\": 70,\n    \"profit_per_trade_pct\": 50,\n    \"weekly_return_target\": 61,\n    \"max_daily_trades\": 10\n  },\n  \"risk_management\": {\n    \"max_position_per_trade_pct\": 5,\n    \"max_leverage\": 10,\n    \"max_single_loss_pct\": 2.5,\n    \"max_daily_loss_pct\": 15,\n    \"max_consecutive_losses\": 3,\n    \"stop_loss_pct\": 50,\n    \"take_profit_pct\": 50,\n    \"force_stop_after_consecutive_losses\": 3\n  },\n  \"trading_rules\": {\n    \"entry_conditions\": [\n      \"趋势确认：标的价格突破关键支撑/阻力位\",\n      \"时机把握：波动率处于合理区间\",\n      \"流动性充足：日均成交量不低于1万张\",\n      \"时间价值：期权到期时间不少于7天\"\n    ],\n    \"exit_conditions\": [\n      \"盈利达到目标：+50%强制平仓\",\n      \"亏损达到止损：-50%强制止损\",\n      \"时间衰减：距离到期3天内逐步平仓\",\n      \"趋势反转：技术指标确认趋势反转\"\n    ],\n    \"禁止事项\": [\n      \"禁止持仓过夜（除非趋势极强且确认）\",\n      \"禁止在没有明确信号时开仓\",\n      \"禁止追涨杀跌\",\n      \"禁止在连续3次止损后继续交易\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"position_sizing\": {\n    \"method\": \"fixed_percentage\",\n    \"base_position_pct\": 5,\n    \"adjustment_rules\": [\n      \"连续盈利2笔，仓位可提升至6%\",\n      \"连续盈利5笔，仓位可提升至7%\",\n      \"首次亏损，仓位降回5%\",\n      \"连续亏损2笔，仓位降至3%\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"market_focus\": [\n    {\n      \"market\": \"美股期权\",\n      \"symbols\": [\"NVDA\", \"TSLA\", \"AAPL\", \"MSFT\", \"AMZN\"],\n      \"liquidity\": \"high\",\n      \"leverage\": \"10-20x\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"market\": \"加密货币期权\",\n      \"symbols\": [\"BTC\", \"ETH\"],\n      \"liquidity\": \"medium\",\n      \"leverage\": \"5-10x\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"market\": \"股指期权\",\n      \"symbols\": [\"SPX\", \"NDX\"],\n      \"liquidity\": \"high\",\n      \"leverage\": \"10-15x\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"technical_indicators\": [\n    {\n      \"indicator\": \"RSI\",\n      \"period\": 14,\n      \"long_signal\": \"RSI < 30 (超卖)\",\n      \"short_signal\": \"RSI > 70 (超买)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"indicator\": \"MACD\",\n      \"period\": \"12,26,9\",\n      \"long_signal\": \"金叉\",\n      \"short_signal\": \"死叉\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"indicator\": \"Volume\",\n      \"period\": \"20\",\n      \"signal\": \"成交量放大确认趋势\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"indicator\": \"Implied Volatility (IV)\",\n      \"signal\": \"IV处于30-50百分位时开仓\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tracking_metrics\": {\n    \"daily_metrics\": [\n      \"trades_count\",\n      \"wins_count\",\n      \"losses_count\",\n      \"win_rate\",\n      \"total_profit\",\n      \"total_loss\",\n      \"net_pnl\",\n      \"max_drawdown\",\n      \"average_holding_time\"\n    ],\n    \"weekly_metrics\": [\n      \"total_trades\",\n      \"win_rate\",\n      \"weekly_return\",\n      \"max_consecutive_wins\",\n      \"max_consecutive_losses\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"risk_alerts\": [\n    {\n      \"level\": \"critical\",\n      \"condition\": \"连续3次止损\",\n      \"action\": \"停止当日交易，复盘分析\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"level\": \"high\",\n      \"condition\": \"单日亏损超过10%\",\n      \"action\": \"降低仓位至3%\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"level\": \"medium\",\n      \"condition\": \"胜率低于50%连续3天\",\n      \"action\": \"暂停交易，优化策略\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/strategies/options_high_winrate.json"}}],