{"type":"message","id":"32635bc5","parentId":"bfb5b391","timestamp":"2026-03-23T17:25:36.884Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在需要更新README文件，说明现在有两个策略，并提供快速导航。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d1bbafac88edbeafcc4019a11c1d0","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/workspace/projects/workspace/strategies/README.md","newText":"# 期权交易策略系统 - 双策略版本\n\n## ⚠️ 重要提示\n\n**本系统现在包含两个完全独立的策略：**\n\n1. **策略1：高胜率期权日内交易**（70%胜率目标）\n2. **策略2：彩票单深度价外期权**（<10%胜率目标，赌博性质）\n\n**两策略资金和账户完全独立，请分别查看对应文件。**\n\n---\n\n## 📁 快速导航\n\n### 查看策略总览\n\n📄 **[STRATEGY_OVERVIEW.md](./STRATEGY_OVERVIEW.md)** - 两策略完整对比和说明\n\n### 策略1：高胜率期权日内交易\n\n📄 **[options_high_winrate.json](./options_high_winrate.json)** - 策略配置  \n📊 **[options_tracking.md](./options_tracking.md)** - 交易追踪表  \n💰 **[options_account.json](./options_account.json)** - 账户状态  \n📖 **[options_execution_rules.md](./options_execution_rules.md)** - 执行规则手册\n\n### 策略2：彩票单（深度价外期权）\n\n🎲 **[options_lottery_tracking.md](./options_lottery_tracking.md)** - 彩票单追踪表  \n💰 **[options_lottery_account.json](./options_lottery_account.json)** - 彩票单账户  \n📖 **[LOTTERY_EXECUTION_GUIDE.md](./LOTTERY_EXECUTION_GUIDE.md)** - 彩票单执行指南\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 策略1：高胜率期权日内交易","oldText":"# 期权高胜率交易策略 - 系统启动指南"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":2454,"output":423,"cacheRead":134080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":136957,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774286729865}}
